{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06482","headline":"题沈东美员外山池 · 綦毋潜","name":"题沈东美员外山池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙郎偏好道，凿沼象瀛洲。\n鱼乐随情性，船行任去留。\n秦人辨鸡犬，尧日识巢由。\n归客衡门外，仍怜返景幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"綦毋潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}